  "steps": [
    "Toss strawberries with 5 g oat flour (from the 120 g)",
    "Preheat air fryer/oven to 160°C for 3 minutes.",
    "Banana + skyr + ghee + monk fruit + milk + lemon juice + vanilla. Whisk till smooth and glossy.",
    "In another bowl mix oat flour + protein + baking powder + baking soda + salt + cinnamon.",
    "Fold dry into wet gently.",
    "Do NOT overmix. Slight lumps are fine.",
    "Fold in strawberries + walnuts.",
    "Let batter rest 5 minutes.",
    "Fill greased aluminium muffin moulds ¾ full.",
    "Air fry at 150–155°C for 14–17 minutes. (If tops brown early, loosely tent with foil. Toothpick should show moist crumbs (not wet batter). Or bake at 170°C for 16–19 minutes (until toothpick shows moist crumbs).",
